{
  "name": "Twin Bird Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have two [Throwing] weapons equipped to your [Hand Slots]. Your [Attack Power] is the sum of the two weapons and your Range is equal to the lowest range of the two.</p>\n<p>(SR2): Gain +2 [Accuracy].<br>(SR3): Your \"Shadowless Kick\" becomes [Range: 1 Sq].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style that uses thrown weapons with both hands and fires continuously.</p>",
